      "unit": "°",
      "tolerance": 0.02,
      "explanation": "\\(\\angle L(j\\omega_c)=-90^\\circ-\\tan^{-1}(2.54/3)=-130.3^\\circ\\), so PM \\(=180-130.3=49.7^\\circ\\). The integrator contributes the fixed \\(-90^\\circ\\), and the plant pole adds the rest.\n• 40.3° is the pole's phase alone.\n• 130.3° is the phase lag, not the margin.\n• 90° forgets the pole.",
      "figure": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Bode magnitude of 10/(s(s+3)): -20 dB per decade, then -40, crossing 0 dB near 2.5 rad/s.\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" style=\"max-width:340px;width:100%;height:auto\"><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"176\"/><polygon points=\"330,176 323.6,178.7 323.6,173.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"16\"/><polygon points=\"50,16 52.7,22.4 47.3,22.4\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">log10 ω (rad/s)</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">|H| (dB)</text><polyline points=\"50,41.6 52.2,42.2 54.5,42.9 56.8,43.5 59,44.2 61.2,44.9 63.5,45.5 65.8,46.2 68,46.8 70.2,47.5 72.5,48.2 74.8,48.8 77,49.5 79.2,50.1 81.5,50.8 83.8,51.5 86,52.1 88.2,52.8 90.5,53.4 92.8,54.1 95,54.8 97.2,55.4 99.5,56.1 101.8,56.8 104,57.4 106.2,58.1 108.5,58.8 110.8,59.4 113,60.1 115.2,60.8 117.5,61.5 119.8,62.2 122,62.8 124.2,63.5 126.5,64.2 128.8,64.9 131,65.6 133.2,66.3 135.5,67 137.8,67.7 140,68.4 142.2,69.2 144.5,69.9 146.8,70.6 149,71.4 151.2,72.2 153.5,72.9 155.8,73.7 158,74.5 160.2,75.3 162.5,76.1 164.8,77 167,77.8 169.2,78.7 171.5,79.6 173.8,80.5 176,81.4 178.2,82.3 180.5,83.3 182.8,84.3 185,85.2 187.2,86.3 189.5,87.3 191.8,88.3 194,89.4 196.2,90.5 198.5,91.6 200.8,92.7 203,93.8 205.2,95 207.5,96.2 209.8,97.3 212,98.5 214.2,99.7 216.5,100.9 218.8,102.1 221,103.4 223.2,104.6 225.5,105.8 227.8,107.1 230,108.4 232.2,109.6 234.5,110.9 236.8,112.2 239,113.4 241.2,114.7 243.5,116 245.7,117.3 248,118.6 250.2,119.9 252.5,121.2 254.8,122.5 257,123.8 259.2,125.1 261.5,126.4 263.8,127.7 266,129 268.2,130.3 270.5,131.6 272.8,132.9 275,134.2 277.2,135.5 279.5,136.8 281.8,138.1 284,139.4