      "round": 3,
      "type": "numeric",
      "prompt": "A heating loop has \\(L(s)=\\dfrac{2e^{-0.5s}}{s+1}\\), with a 0.5 s transport delay. Without the delay, crossover is at \\(\\omega_c=\\sqrt3\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}\\) with PM = 120°. What is the phase margin WITH the delay, in degrees?",
